        "country": "us",
        "userName": "Captain1328",
        "score": 4,
        "text": "I’m not sure what all the hate is for this game. I guess it could seem boring and repetitive to most, but it’s a great idle game to take up some time. I personally don’t think any of the levels are too difficult. I do wish they did power ups, maybe some new types of balls (steel diamond, etc. whatever.) and maybe some new types of blocks. But I do enjoy. playing it several times a day. \nAlso, unlike other games, at least you only get an ad every three or four levels and they’re very short ads. Just removing one star hoping they update to add some new features.",
